{"id":"ics-043","stemHtml":"<p>在 32 位 <code>int</code>（补码）与 32 位 <code>unsigned</code> 环境下，有下面两个函数：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">int      ge (int      x) { return x + 1 &gt; x; }\nunsigned uge(unsigned x) { return x + 1 &gt; x; }</code></pre></p>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<p>(1) 在 <code>-O2</code> 下，<code>ge</code> 常被编译成 <code>movl $1, %eax; ret</code>（直接返回 1）。编译器凭什么这样做？</p>\n<p>(2) <code>uge</code> 是否对一切 <code>unsigned</code> 都返回 1？若不是，给出反例并算出返回值。</p>\n<p>(3) 在 <code>-O0</code> 下执行 <code>ge(INT_MAX)</code>，机器上实际返回什么？为什么这个结果不能用来否定 (1) 中编译器优化的合法性？</p>\n<p>(4) 写出一个对所有 <code>int</code> 都正确、且不产生未定义行为的版本，用来判断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+1&gt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>(5) <code>gcc -fwrapv</code> 会让 (1) 的优化失效吗？说明原因。</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>关键是分清两件事：<strong>C 语言语义</strong>和<strong>机器实际执行</strong>。C 标准对 <code>int</code> 溢出的规定不是&quot;回绕&quot;，而是&quot;未定义行为（UB）&quot;。</p>\n<p>对 UB，编译器可以做任意假设。想想&quot;如果 <code>x+1</code> 不溢出&quot;，那么 <code>x+1 &gt; x</code> 还不真吗？</p>\n<code>unsigned</code> 的运算则被规定为模 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回绕，是被精确定义的。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> C 标准规定：<code>int</code> 运算溢出是未定义行为。编译器可以<strong>假定程序中不出现 UB</strong>（否则这段程序的行为没有任何保证）。既然 <code>x+1</code> 不发生溢出，那么对任意 <code>int x</code> 都有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+1&gt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>，于是函数等价于</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">int ge(int x) { return 1; }</code></pre></p>\n<p>编译成 <code>movl $1, %eax; ret</code> 完全合法。关键的那一步是理解&quot;UB 不是'结果不确定'，而是'编译器可以假设它不发生'&quot;——这是 C 优化里最反直觉的一条。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> <code>unsigned</code> 的加法是模 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的，标准明确规定了回绕。取 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4294967295</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=4294967295</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4294967295</span></span></span></span>（<code>UINT_MAX</code>）：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+1=0\\pmod{2^{32}},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>于是</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4294967295</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&gt;4294967295</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4294967295</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>为假，函数返回 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。所以 <code>uge</code> 不是恒真函数，编译器也不能把它优化成 <code>return 1</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> <code>-O0</code> 下按机器指令直译：<code>x=INT_MAX=0x7FFFFFFF</code>，<code>addl $1</code> 得 <code>0x80000000</code>，即 <code>INT_MIN</code>；随后按有符号比较 <code>INT_MIN &gt; INT_MAX</code> 为假，返回 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>但这是<strong>机器实现</strong>的行为，不是 C 语义规定的行为。C 语义下 <code>x+1</code> 溢出属于 UB，程序已经&quot;不受标准约束&quot;；编译器在 <code>-O2</code> 下假定它不会发生并返回 1，也是合法的。二者不矛盾：UB 让两种结果都&quot;合法&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 在补码、无溢出前提下有等价关系</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">INT_MAX</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+1&gt;x \\iff x\\ne\\texttt{INT\\_MAX},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8055em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">INT_MAX</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>所以安全写法是</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;limits.h&gt;\nint ge_safe(int x) { return x != INT_MAX; }</code></pre></p>\n<p>或者先转成无符号再比（注意只对非负 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 等价，负数的转换会破坏直觉，不要随手用）：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">int ge_safe2(int x) { return (long long)x + 1 &gt; (long long)x; }</code></pre></p>\n<code>long long</code> 能容纳所有 <code>int</code> 加 1 的结果，不会溢出，这是最直白的修法。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> 会。<code>-fwrapv</code> 明确告诉编译器：有符号溢出按补码回绕处理（定义良好）。这样 <code>x+1</code> 在 <code>INT_MAX</code> 处会回绕成 <code>INT_MIN</code>，<code>x+1&gt;x</code> 在该点不再成立，编译器就不能把它优化成恒真。这是&quot;用定义良好的行为换掉 UB&quot;的典型编译选项；代价是丢失一部分基于 UB 的优化机会。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<ul>\n<li>把&quot;溢出&quot;当成&quot;回绕&quot;。补码回绕在 C 里只对无符号数成立；有符号溢出是 UB。</li>\n<li>认为 <code>-O0</code> 下观察到返回 0，就说明 <code>-O2</code> 的 <code>return 1</code> 是编译器 bug。两者在 UB 下都合法。</li>\n<li>写 <code>return (unsigned)x + 1 &gt; (unsigned)x;</code> 来&quot;修复&quot;。对负数会出错：<code>x=-1</code> 时 <code>(unsigned)x=UINT_MAX</code>，<code>+1</code> 回绕为 0，<code>0 &gt; UINT_MAX</code> 为假，但 <code>-1+1=0 &gt; -1</code> 为真。</li>\n<li>认为 <code>-fwrapv</code> 会&quot;让程序更不安全&quot;。它只是把回绕定义清楚，避免基于 UB 的激进化，行为更可预测。</li>\n</ul>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 有符号溢出是未定义行为，编译器可假定不发生，故 <code>x+1&gt;x</code> 恒真、可优化成 <code>return 1</code>；(2) 不恒真，<code>x = UINT_MAX</code> 时返回 0；(3) 硬件回绕得 <code>INT_MIN</code>，比较为假返回 0，但这是 UB 下的实现细节，不构成 C 语义的反例；(4) <code>x != INT_MAX</code>（或 <code>x &lt; INT_MAX</code>）；(5) <code>-fwrapv</code> 把回绕定义为补码回绕，编译器不能再做该优化</p>\n"}